=== closing ===
I am on duty. I will stick to what I observed. The rest belongs to the archives and the Sanhedrin's emergency sessions. But I have told you what I saw — a man with a whip of rushes, declaring that God's house is a house of prayer. And that declaration changed everything.
-> DONE
